<title>UK: Spintab sets 125 mln Swiss franc Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets 125 mln Swiss franc Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    24.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE   S24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> FITCH	AA-	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
